00:09:22.780 --> 00:09:23.360
Thank you, Doctor.

00:09:24.520 --> 00:09:26.720
It is customary that I send you a statement.

00:09:26.880 --> 00:09:28.540
No statements this time and no reports.

00:09:29.490 --> 00:09:29.970
As you would.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:33.050
Thank you, Geet. Good evening.

00:09:33.470 --> 00:09:40.240
How do you know he'll keep his word?

00:09:40.520 --> 00:09:42.240
He will if he intends to stay in Macau.

00:09:42.880 --> 00:09:44.800
I better remember you in case I get a parking ticket.

00:09:45.340 --> 00:09:46.660
Come on, we'll find your shirt and tie.

00:09:48.380 --> 00:09:52.160
